B.BV=s(["Sr. Technical Project Manager","Indeed.com","indeed.png","- Owned strategic initiatives across Indeed\u2019s Job Seeker-facing mobile apps (iOS, Android), used by millions globally. Directed product strategy and coordinated execution across Platform, Experience, and Growth teams.\n- Partnered with Engineering, Design, and UX to deliver improvements contributing to 25% YoY growth, achieving 4.4B user sessions/year and elevating the app into the top 10 US iPhone apps.\n- Managed timelines for Indeed\u2019s first AI-powered, customer-facing product. Led roadmap execution from initial concept through early user testing and press launch readiness over a year-long development cycle, contributing to one of the company\u2019s top product initiatives.\n- Led product planning and rollout of native screen migrations (WebView to Swift/Jetpack Compose/React Native), doubling engagement on key journeys, improving load times, and UX.\n- Spearheaded Indeed\u2019s Global Hackathons, fostering innovation with many new product ideas from hundreds of participants across the US, Japan, and India. Partnered with SLT to integrate top concepts into product roadmaps.\n- Collaborated with Legal and Engineering on compliance and technical migrations for the Messaging Platform. Refined roadmap execution for international markets by driving data-driven and regulation-compliant product requirements."],t.s)
B.DR=s(["Technical Project Manager","Indeed.com","indeed.png","- Supported early-stage product experimentation by optimizing our Product Operating Model, reducing MVP launch times from 8 to 6 weeks. Collaborated with PMs and UX to integrate product feedback loops into our internal hiring tools before rolling them out to customers.\n- Introduced operational frameworks and a portfolio management system, improving alignment across multiple product areas and enabling better roadmap planning and transparency."],t.s)
B.CI=s(["Project & Engagement\nManager","Indeed.com","indeed.png","- Drove vendor product evaluations and tech migrations, aligning solutions to business needs while phasing out homegrown tools.\n- Managed critical product development timelines by working with 3rd-party vendors to improve project value, velocity, & quality. Grew a diverse portfolio for software, infrastructure, & engineering teams distributed across the company."],t.s)
B.CS=s(["Founder","Certainly Apps","ca.png","- Co-created B2C & B2B geolocation software focused on reducing food insecurity via community-driven reporting.\n- Led customer discovery and translated findings into product iterations, ultimately shifting focus from campus food apps to non-profit food distribution tools."],t.s)
B.CP=s(["Sr. Lab Manager","RIT Makerspace","rit.jpg","- Managed a makerspace to address the needs of its community, ensuring members had the materials, tools, and understanding to develop projects in electronics, programming, and rapid prototyping. Collaborated with the department leads to scale operations 300%."],t.s)
B.BP=s(["Quality Engineering Intern","Dark Field Technologies","df.png","- Developed, tested, and installed quality inspection systems for fortune-500 companies needing innovative in-line defect monitoring. Improved the flagship product by 65% in detection quality."],t.s)
B.BW=s(["Manufacturing Engineer","Hz Innovations (Wavio)","wavio.png","- Coordinated initial manufacturing for a smart-home IoT device offering AI sound recognition for the deaf/HoH community. Prototyped electronics and field tested units while contributing to the growth of the startup."],t.s)
B.DV=s(["Research Assistant","Lewis & Clark College","lc.jpg","- Aided in research and peer-review of a paper on \u2018The Theory of Mind\u2019. Organized and analyzed experiments to study behavioral patterns in young children.\n"],t.s)
